    "2組104枚を使います。場札（10列）で同じスートの札を K から A まで順に並べると、その13枚は自動的に場から取り除かれます。8組すべて取り除いたらクリアです" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Played with two decks (104 cards). Line up a full suit from K down to A on the tableau (10 columns) and those 13 cards are removed automatically. Remove all 8 sets to clear the game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2組104枚を同じスートでK→Aに。1・2・4スートの3難度" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Two decks: build each suit from K down to A. Play with 1, 2 or 4 suits"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4 種すべての 104 枚。もっとも難しく、配られる配札はすべて勝ち筋を確認済みです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "104 cards in all 4 suits. The hardest mode, and every deal is checked to be winnable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8 組でクリア" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
